{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act36side_level_act36side_03_beg",
  "groupId": "act36side",
  "stageId": "act36side_03",
  "title": "黄金萝卜",
  "storyCode": "DT-3",
  "avgTag": "行动前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act36side/level_act36side_03_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "8939a0b181edf6027ca09c134cfe876740babd5ed2de0bee2bca196a524fc047",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "46_g4_rmbtwild_d"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呼......呼......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（哼歌）"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "这片荒地根本看不到头，我们得走到什么时候啊——\n喂，你这家伙也太开心了吧......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（哼歌）因为我得到了一件这个世界的魔法器具呀~"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "齐尔查克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4144_chilc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不过就是别人不要的东西......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哼，难道你看到一种全新的开锁工具不会觉得开心吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "来到这个世界后，我一直觉得自己的魔法施展得没有之前那么顺畅了，这里好像有一股我没能利用上的......奇怪的魔力。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是现在我有了这个D32钢手电筒！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "老板说这种叫“D32钢”的材料可以承载更大的能量输出，这里的魔法师会用它来做魔法器具，说不定我能通过它更好地使用魔法呢！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而且我亲眼见到老板用它施放了类似闪光魔法的法术！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4143_sensi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "老夫总觉得，世上不会有不需要付出努力就可以得到的好东西。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可能老板不希望好东西被白白浪费，就送给了我这个超厉害的魔法师吧~"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我现在对这个世界的魔法原理超感兴趣的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔......那要不要趁现在多练习练习？玛露西尔，你能试试用它把那些果子弄下来吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这里长果子的树真的很少，也就水边有这么几棵，错过了可能就没有了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "其实是你想尝尝那些果子吧......\n好吧，就当作是练习吧，我试试好了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "一片安静。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "齐尔查克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4144_chilc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "什么都没有发生呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎、怎么可能！之前在老板手里明明还能正常用的，而且我有感觉到它在回应我......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "齐尔查克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4144_chilc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那就是错觉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哼！我再来一遍！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔唔......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "又是一片安静。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "齐尔查克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4144_chilc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "还是什么都没有发生哦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "齐尔查克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4144_chilc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "玛露西尔，这个什么手电筒你真的能用吗......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要不还是用法杖吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不过是还需要适应的问题！只要给我一点时间，我就能弄明白......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呼——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘿......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哦！成功了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "玛露西尔，你果然......呃？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎么你炸的是自己？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咳咳咳咳！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咳咳咳咳！咳咳咳咳！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "齐尔查克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4144_chilc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......都说了不要逞强硬来啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎么回事......为什么魔法会从这个魔法器具的末端冒出来......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他们这里的魔法器具怎么这么难控制......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4143_sensi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以老夫很讨厌魔法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这不一样......！咳咳咳咳咳！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "下一次，下一次我一定就能成功了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "46_g1_transporter"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "老板！这个D32钢手电筒好像有问题——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "厂主",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_242",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不是吧！白送给你我最宝贝的D32钢手电筒，还要被你们找麻烦？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咳咳......没有！我只是想问问，你们这里还有相关的书卖吗？我还是想系统地学一下......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "厂主",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_242",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那没有，你以为我这里是什么地方？这就是一个快要倒闭的工厂，除了已经造好的武器就是些矿石机器，别的都没有！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "厂主",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_242",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你要是不想要就还给我！......我就知道，没有一个识货的！难道它不酷吗？你甚至能用它照亮整片夜空！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "厂主",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_242",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这么好用的东西大家却不懂得欣赏，一个都没卖出去......害得我的工厂都要倒闭了......我本来以为终于遇到了一个有眼光的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我、我不是这个意思......！既然没有就算了，等我研究明白这里的魔法原理，我再试试看！总之......谢谢老板的礼物！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那我们还是继续去找罗德岛吧——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "齐尔查克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4144_chilc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "欸？又要去那片荒地吗？这个世界太大了，光靠腿走，在找到罗德岛之前我们就会累死吧......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯......好像没见到这里有马车，但是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "老板，你的这个......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "厂主",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_242",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "车？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喔，原来这种东西也是车......它多少钱呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "厂主",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_242",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嚯！虽然我的工厂要倒闭了，但这辆车还是值点钱的，你们看起来不像是能买得起的啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "齐尔查克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4144_chilc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但我们靠走真的能找到罗德岛吗......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工人A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1185_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "老板，给你，午饭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工人B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1186_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不过老板，厂子都要倒闭了，能卖点就卖点呗，要不工资都发不出来......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工人B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1186_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "萝卜饭团都吃了多久了，之前你还说今天的散伙饭要请大伙吃黄金萝卜烧烤，希望大家迈向新未来呢！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "厂主",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_242",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那我也得有钱请你们吃啊，把车卖了我可就什么都没有了......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "厂主",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_242",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "行了，几位，我们也要开始整理做散伙饭的东西了，就不招呼你们了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4143_sensi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......散伙饭？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工人A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1185_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉，萝卜和米都在那，也没什么要准备的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工人B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1186_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们开厂第一顿饭吃的就是黄金萝卜呢......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "厂主",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_242",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "厂主",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_242",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "厂主",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_242",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要是能给你们变出来黄金萝卜，我就变出来了。现在不是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "厂主",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_242",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要是有能力，我也想把这个仪式坚持下去......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "厂主",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_242",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4143_sensi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4143_sensi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你们这里吃黄金萝卜......是传统吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工人A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1185_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯，是啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工人A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1185_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只要是聚餐，我们都会有一道黄金萝卜。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工人B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1186_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但今天也没办法了吧，现在去哪里搞黄金萝卜？散伙饭嘛，有烤肉配着萝卜片包米饭吃，也就差不多了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4143_sensi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "能把你们的食材都给老夫看看吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工人A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1185_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就是这几筐萝卜和那边的肉......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工人B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1186_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你要干什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4143_sensi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "老夫明白了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4143_sensi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "把食材都交给老夫吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4143_sensi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "老夫给你们做一顿饭，让你们能够好好地互相告别。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "厂主&工人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "厂主",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_242",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（小声）森西为什么这样......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "齐尔查克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4144_chilc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（小声）你忘了，他加入我们小队就是因为看不下去莱欧斯做饭啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "齐尔查克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4144_chilc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（小声）他估计很难接受别人不好好吃饭吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4143_sensi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "吃饭不仅仅是生活的一部分，其中还寄托了人们的情感......老夫都明白。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4143_sensi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "老夫会帮你们搞到黄金萝卜的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工人A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1185_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真、真的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4143_sensi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "萝卜你们这里倒是有很多，老夫也能够帮你们做出一顿饭来，但是黄金萝卜到底是什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4143_sensi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就是金色的萝卜吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工人A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1185_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你们几个不是雷姆必拓人吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工人A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1185_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "黄金萝卜可是我们这里的传统美食。又有矿石又有萝卜，雷姆必拓两大特色！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4143_sensi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你们还吃矿石？是怎么料理的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工人B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1186_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "吃矿石？怎么可能！黄金萝卜上面的金粉是“赤金源石虫”的分泌物做的，只不过我们现在没法专门花钱买这种东西了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工人B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1186_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不过要是能找到赤金源石虫，现做也完全没问题。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4143_sensi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "老夫明白了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4143_sensi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那哪里会有这种赤金源石虫？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工人A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1185_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "矿洞里，荒野上，只要人少的地方都可能有。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工人A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1185_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喏，那边的坑洞一看就是源石虫的巢穴，那边的矿洞口也有两个巢穴，再那边的洞口已经长草了，看来是被源石虫废弃了，应该是空的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工人A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1185_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不过这附近的赤金源石虫都被捉得差不多了，估计有点难找到呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4143_sensi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工人A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1185_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那个，虽说工厂要倒闭了，但我最后一天的活还没干完......要是你们能找到赤金源石虫，我们真的会非常感谢你们的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（小声）虽然肚子确实有点饿了，但我们去罗德岛的事怎么办？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那如果我们帮你们做出黄金萝卜的话，你能不能考虑便宜卖我们这辆车的事情？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "厂主",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_242",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我......我会考虑的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "46_g4_rmbtwild_d"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这里肯定有源石虫，我都听到它们爬行的声音了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "齐尔查克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4144_chilc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃......这么多！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "齐尔查克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4144_chilc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们要怎么找到赤金源石虫？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "齐尔查克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4144_chilc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而且源石虫我们见过，也就大鲍勃能让它们安静下来，它们攻击性挺强的，看起来不像是能简单地获取它们分泌物的样子啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看来......只能战斗了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我明白了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你们都让开，让我再试一下这个魔法器具，这次我一定能用它正常放出魔法！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "玛露西尔举起D32钢手电筒，闭上双眼，努力地感受蕴含在其中的能量。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "齐尔查克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4144_chilc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她刚才可是失败了的，现在真的能行吗......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4143_sensi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等一下！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——欸？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "手电筒发出的光芒并没有因为森西的打断而停下，反而更加耀眼——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4143_sensi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "玛露西尔，不要把它们全杀了，要杀就一只一只地——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "齐尔查克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4144_chilc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等等，森西......现在好像不是说这个的时候......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "齐尔查克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4144_chilc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "玛露西尔拿的那个东西好像......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "玛露西尔身旁逐渐显现出耀眼的光芒，她的头发随着力量的波动飞舞起来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯&齐尔查克",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要睁不开眼睛了......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎、怎么回事！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那边的源石虫好像发现我们了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我看到了，我、我没法很好地控制这个魔法器具......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "没事，玛露西尔，你再试一下，说不定就能成功了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "感受魔力从四周被汲取而来，力量从我的指尖流向魔法器具，然后放出——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "魔法的学习与施展，需要在一次次的突破中更加专注、更加严谨、更加真诚。\n真正需要的是对魔法的那份至高理念的理解、接受和觉悟！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "就在这时，玛露西尔对于这个世界中全新的魔法的向往令她创造出了一份奇迹——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "成功了？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "成功了......吗？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "源石虫群",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（谨慎地停下）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不清楚，好像我刚才释放出了一个什么东西，但是它消失了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不过我现在又感受到它的存在了......小心！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "它比我预计的要猛烈很多！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "............！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我感觉到它要爆炸了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "几人跑去躲在岩石后面，紧紧地缩成一团，试图依靠岩石挡住爆炸的冲击。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "经历了漫长的等待之后，一丝不妙的声响逐渐从地下传了上来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "嗞......儿......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "什么声音......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "源石虫群",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（谨慎地缩着）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不过眼前这群看起来都不是赤金源石虫啊......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要不我们先跑，再换个地方找找看？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4143_sensi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "老夫刚刚觉得自己脚下似乎松了一下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "齐尔查克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4144_chilc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯，我也听到脚下有碎裂的声音，我猜玛露西尔的魔法应该是不知道为什么放在了我们——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "齐尔查克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4144_chilc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "脚下啊啊啊啊啊——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
